# 8. Two scenario modes

Very important:

```text
HISTORICAL MODE
```

requires:

```text
temporal_overlap > threshold
geographic_overlap > threshold
environment_compatibility > threshold
```

versus:

```text
LAB MODE
```

where:

```text
coexistence = irrelevant
```

but morphology remains historically reconstructed.

Then the interface can literally say:

```text
TITANOBOA vs TYRANNOSAURUS

Historical encounter: IMPOSSIBLE

Experimental simulation:
enabled
```

That's cleaner than pretending they could meet.

