# 9. The simulator

The strongest open-source project I found for our conceptual model is:

## `michaelkoelle/marl-aquarium`

This is an actual configurable predator–prey multi-agent environment built around PettingZoo. It has customizable arena dimensions and agent/environment properties, plus rendering of view cones, force vectors and hitboxes. ([GitHub][12])

We should study its architecture rather than copy its biological model.

Especially:

```text
agent observation
agent action
environment
step()
reward/state
render
```

